  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of risk ratios (TBST vs TST) for swelling/oedema, from three C-Tb studies (Aggerbeck 2018, Hoff 2016, Ruhwald 2017). The overall random-effects pooled risk ratio is 1.04 (0.68–1.59).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسب الخطر (TBST مقابل TST) بالنسبة إلى التورّم/الوذمة، من ثلاث دراسات عن C-Tb (Aggerbeck 2018 وHoff 2016 وRuhwald 2017). وتبلغ نسبة الخطر المجمّعة الإجمالية بنموذج التأثيرات العشوائية 1.04 (0.68–1.59).",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
